  "summary": {
    "en": "In the past 8 hours the DSH ecosystem added 41 new plugins, official repos gained 276 stars, and npm weekly downloads reached 464,199, alongside the dsh 0.2.1-alpha.1 release. However, 13,303 of 17,516 non-fork plugins have been stale for over 7 days, giving a health score of 39 — activity, not total count, is the metric to watch.",
    "zh": "过去 8 小时生态新增 <b>41</b> 个插件，官方仓库星标涨了 <b>276</b>，npm 周下载量 <b>46.4 万</b>；官方刚发布 dsh 0.2.1-alpha.1。不过 <b>17516</b> 个非 fork 插件里有 <b>13303</b> 个超过 7 天没动静，健康分只有 <b>39</b>，建议持续观察活跃度而非总量。"
